---
---

<section id="wcag" class="bg-canvas-soft py-20 w-full" style="scroll-margin-top: 80px;">
	<div class="w-full px-lg" style="margin: 0 auto; max-width: 80rem;">
		<div class="mb-12">
			<h2 class="text-display-lg mb-4">Understanding WCAG Contrast Requirements</h2>
			<p class="text-body-lg text-body">
				WCAG 2.2 defines minimum contrast ratios for different text sizes and accessibility levels. AA is
				the recommended standard; AAA is enhanced.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="overflow-x-auto">
			<table class="w-full">
				<thead>
					<tr class="border-b border-hairline">
						<th class="text-left text-caption-mono text-body py-3 px-4">Criterion</th>
						<th class="text-left text-caption-mono text-body py-3 px-4">Text Size</th>
						<th class="text-left text-caption-mono text-body py-3 px-4">AA Ratio</th>
						<th class="text-left text-caption-mono text-body py-3 px-4">AAA Ratio</th>
					</tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					<tr class="border-b border-hairline hover:bg-canvas-soft-2 transition-colors">
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm font-medium">Normal Text</td>
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm">< 18px (14pt)</td>
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm"><strong>4.5:1</strong></td>
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm"><strong>7:1</strong></td>
					</tr>
					<tr class="border-b border-hairline hover:bg-canvas-soft-2 transition-colors">
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm font-medium">Large Text</td>
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm">≥ 18px (14pt) OR bold ≥ 14px</td>
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm"><strong>3:1</strong></td>
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm"><strong>4.5:1</strong></td>
					</tr>
					<tr class="border-b border-hairline hover:bg-canvas-soft-2 transition-colors">
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm font-medium">UI Components</td>
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm">Buttons, inputs, focus indicators</td>
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm"><strong>3:1</strong></td>
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm"><strong>3:1</strong></td>
					</tr>
					<tr class="hover:bg-canvas-soft-2 transition-colors">
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm font-medium">Graphics & Text Images</td>
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm">Logos, decorative elements</td>
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm">No minimum</td>
						<td class="py-3 px-4 text-body-sm">No minimum</td>
					</tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-12">
			<div class="card-marketing">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>
					<h3 class="text-display-sm mb-0">What is Contrast Ratio?</h3>
				</div>
				<p class="text-body-md text-body mb-4">
					Contrast ratio measures the difference in luminance between two colors on a scale of 1:1 to
					21:1. Higher ratios are more accessible.
				</p>
				<p class="text-body-sm text-mute">
					Formula: (L1 + 0.05) / (L2 + 0.05), where L is relative luminance.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card-marketing">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line></svg>
					<h3 class="text-display-sm mb-0">AA vs AAA</h3>
				</div>
				<p class="text-body-md text-body mb-4">
					<strong>AA</strong> is the standard required by law in most jurisdictions. <strong>AAA</strong> is
					enhanced and recommended for sensitive content like medical or educational materials.
				</p>
				<p class="text-body-sm text-mute">Start with AA. Aim for AAA when possible.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
